id: SAVE6-1
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: reload_busy
target: crates/core/src/projection.rs
find:             | Event::Reloaded { .. } => self.push_row(i, event),
replace:             | Event::Reloaded { .. } => {}
expect-fail: each_reload_adds_one_log_row
note: 再読み込みを右のログの行にしない（SAVE-6・D-57）。
